  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Advisory Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contract consists in the provision of advisory services to the European Commission, in Brussels headquarters but also in EU delegations in partner countries, with the aim to improving the effectiveness of the EU&apos;s development aid on education through adequate support to staff in charge of operations in the education sector at the key steps of the project/programme cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
